  "description": "The client half of Rask.Cqrs remote dispatch. Register it and a message with no local handler is sent to the server through the same `IDispatcher` call — queries as GET, commands as POST, files as multipart, subscriptions as server-sent events — with no HttpClient at the call site. Reflection-free: the wire codecs are source-generated, so it publishes clean under the WASM/AOT trimmer.",
